IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. BATCH001.
       AUTHOR. RENAVOTIO EVAL.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-COUNTER      PIC 9(5) VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-TOTAL        PIC 9(7) VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-RECORD       PIC X(80).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       INITIALIZE-SECTION.
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-COUNTER.
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-TOTAL.

       PROCESS-SECTION.
           PERFORM UNTIL WS-COUNTER > 100
               READ INPUT-FILE INTO WS-RECORD
                   AT END
                       EXIT PERFORM
               END-READ
               ADD 1 TO WS-COUNTER
               COMPUTE WS-TOTAL = WS-TOTAL + FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-RECORD)
           END-PERFORM.

       FINALIZE-SECTION.
           DISPLAY 'PROCESSED: ' WS-COUNTER ' RECORDS'.
           DISPLAY 'TOTAL: ' WS-TOTAL.
           STOP RUN.